# Settings for swift-app-kit's setup.sh. It reads this with bash, so quote values.

APP_NAME="Cairn"
BUNDLE_ID="local.cairn"
SYMBOL="square.stack.3d.up"
GLYPH="glyph.png"
INSTALL_NOTES="Look for the stacked stones in the menu bar.

  • It shows your local Cairn and your team's, and controls the local server.
  • The server runs on its own and keeps running when Cairn quits. If you haven't set it up:
    curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VedAtal/cairn/main/install.sh | sh
  • Cairn starts automatically at login."
